Me listening to two pro se
parties argue in open court.

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:36.130
They're just like, they're
puppets or something.

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:37.070
So, pro se litigant

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.290
is someone who doesn't have a lawyer.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:42.550
And I have been in so
different court hearings

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:46.700
