exam knocking on their door.

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:19.520
Oh boy, that brings me back.
That really brings me back.

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:22.520
The thing is with law school,
you go there for three years.

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:23.353
The third year (knuckle pops)

00:01:23.353 --> 00:01:25.530
