00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.673
And unless you got a cushy big firm job,

00:01:40.673 --> 00:01:42.860
you might not have very much money

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:44.510
to actually study for the bar

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:46.280
over the period of three to four months

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:47.750
before you take the bar exam.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.163
So, yeah,

00:01:51.178 --> 00:01:52.050
it's a tough time.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:56.260
And man, the bar exam studying is no joke.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.944
It really does sap up
every ounce (chuckles)

00:01:59.944 --> 00:02:01.580
