00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:37.590
But the civil litigators should just have

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:41.340
cups and cups of espresso

00:02:42.422 --> 00:02:43.780
'cause we're working

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:45.779
