00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.380
Ah.

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:46.810
I love law school. I really did.

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:49.130
I had a great time. It's not for everyone.

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.890
If you don't know what you
wanna do with your life,

00:07:50.890 --> 00:07:52.290
do not go to law school.

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:55.050
If you know for a fact
