00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:57.400
law school's probably for you
and you might enjoy it too.

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:59.310
But look, there's a lot of stress,

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:02.240
but I don't think anyone is an idiot

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:04.747
