Lawyer. (laughs)

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:17.480
It do be like that sometimes.
It do be like that sometimes.

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:18.850
(upbeat music)

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:19.683
You're getting...

00:08:19.683 --> 00:08:21.350
A raise? Oh my god, partnership?

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:24.470
The MSJ we just got served with. (laughs)

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.600
All right, MSJ is motion
for summary judgment.

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.010
And as we talked about before,

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:29.630
it's really hard to make partner.

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:30.770
It's very easy to get served

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:32.350
