00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:33.870
That is like a trial on paper.

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:34.850
You're taking all the evidence,

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:35.850
and you're saying,

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:39.350
