the evidence is true, I win.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:40.670
And of course, the defense attorneys

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:42.480
are going to have to defend against that.

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:43.640
And it takes a lot of work

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:45.960
to fight a motion for summary judgment.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:47.500
So, yeah, I feel for Pam here.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.333
And in fact,

00:08:48.333 --> 00:08:51.710
I think, the first four Christmases

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.270
I ever worked at a big firm,

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:56.240
I was defending against a
motion for summary judgment.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:57.430
As you become more senior,

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.820
