(upbeat music)

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.000
When the judge clowns you

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.890
and everyone including your
client (laughs) starts laughing.

00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:04.880
Look, the judge is the king
or queen of the kingdom here,

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:07.490
and if they start clowning you,

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:09.450
you just sit there and you take it.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:13.095
And you say, yes, sir, may I have another?

00:11:13.095 --> 00:11:15.150
- Thank you, sir. May I have another?

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:16.570
- Because there's nothing that you can do.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.449
And actually, if you're client is smart,

00:11:18.449 --> 00:11:20.443
you laugh at the judge's jokes.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:23.730
There's no way around it.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:25.505
- Thank you, sir. May I have another?

00:11:25.505 --> 00:11:26.930
(upbeat music)

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.910
- Her, I bet he's thinking
about other women.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.640
Him, no interest is good
unless it must vest,

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:34.260
if at all, no later than
21 years after some life

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:37.200
in being at the creation
of the interest. (laughs)

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:39.460
That is the rule against
perpetuities there.

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:41.340
That is the hardest thing to learn

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:45.160
in your property law class. (sighs)

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:46.670
I've done a video on this in the past.

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:48.110
It's not worth going into.

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:51.130
It's about limits to
how long after you die

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:54.710
you can control what
the interest is doing,

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:56.640
'cause otherwise, we'd have

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:58.135
to deal with probate,

00:11:58.135 --> 00:12:01.540
decades and decades after someone dies

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.920
and you're dealing with their will.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:06.500
This is funny only to law students.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:07.820
Just consider yourself lucky

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:09.555
that if you don't understand this joke.

00:12:09.555 --> 00:12:11.100
(upbeat music)

